			"hadithnumber": 1802,
			"arabicnumber": 1802,
			"text": "Narrated Jabir: That the Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"When one of you eats food, and he drops a pieces of it, then let him remove anything suspicious from it and eat it. Do not leave it for Ash-Shaitan.\" He said: There is something about this from Anas",
